&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In addition to living our Scout values,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;also bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a degree in &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical, Automotive, Systems Engineering, Industrial Design, or related field &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in &lt;strong&gt;vehicle architecture, platform engineering, and advanced concepts &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;3D CAD tools &lt;/strong&gt;(CATIA, NX, Alias, SolidWorks, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work from Novi, MI from mid-May to mid-August 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in rugged SUVs and Trucks, automotive engineering, and sustainable transportation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and critical thinking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to collaborate cross-functionally and work in a fast-paced team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a proactive and results-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office suite and project management tools is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
