&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work from Columbia, SC&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;from mid-May to mid-August 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in electric vehicles, automotive engineering, and sustainable transportation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and critical thinking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to collaborate cross-functionally and work in a fast-paced team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a proactive and results-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office suite and project management tools is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
