&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Security &amp;amp; Fire Protection Intern will support the Security &amp;amp; Fire Protection department in the development, implementation, and evaluation of site safety, physical security, emergency preparedness, and fire protection programs. This role provides hands-on exposure to industrial security operations, emergency response planning, fire protection systems, and risk mitigation within a large manufacturing or corporate environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The intern will&amp;nbsp;assist&amp;nbsp;with administrative tasks, operational assessments, policy development, and field observations to support the department’s mission of protecting people, property, and operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
