&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;software libraries for controlling and communicating with lab&amp;nbsp;equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
