&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;On-boarding new lab equipment / instrumentation, such as various sensors, DAQs, etc., to continually improve test capabilities and&amp;nbsp;fidelity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
