&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Cost Optimization team will be responsible for Direct Materials Cost (MEK) optimization through VA/VE activities. Further the team will be responsible for the reduction of supplier-related investments (B-Investments) and supplier ED&amp;amp;D Costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reduction of Direct Material costs has a direct impact on the profitability of the Scout Project and is one of the top goals of the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reduction in upfront investments is part of the Strategic Capital Allocation (SCA) targets which Scout Motors is required to fulfill. This is also a top goal of the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Daily Responsibilities of the Internship Program include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
