&lt;li&gt;Facilitating internal idea generation cross-functional workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating external workshops with consultants such as A.T. Kearney, McKinsey, Care Soft and A2Mac1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizing visits to competitive teardown facilities of Care Soft and A2Mac1 to generate more ideas for evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating workshops with Suppliers for idea generation, tracking and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Summarizing findings, preparing management presentations and weekly tracking reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
