&lt;li&gt;Performing hardware and network diagnostics, troubleshooting, and physical repairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in root cause analysis for hardware and software issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assembling, installing, and maintaining equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining inventory and test/tool equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing or contributing to documentation and internal training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing technical support to data center teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing or using scripts to update server and networking hardware&lt;/li&gt;
