&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Professional software engineering experience building scalable, high-performance applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep expertise in one or more programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong proficiency in relevant frameworks and libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid understanding of software design principles, performance optimization, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience implementing quality standards, including accessibility, security, and reliability where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong debugging and profiling skills using development tools and performance monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hands-on experience with testing frameworks and tools relevant to your domain.&lt;/li&gt;
