&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in quality systems or quality engineering, familiar with QMS platforms and digital applications, preferably in aerospace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In-depth working experience of AS9100 or ISO9001 requirements and principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong skills in document control, process mapping, and continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
