&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Daily lunch catered onsite, complimentary barista-made drinks, and fully stocked snacks to keep you fueled&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Intern-exclusive events and mixers, including opportunities to connect with other interns across different teams&lt;/li&gt;
