&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Network security and NAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scripting and automation of network operations activities&lt;/li&gt;
