&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strong excel, data visualization and macro experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ability to understand code and use scripts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
