&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Go-to-Market (GTM) Enablement &amp;amp; Business Value team plays an integral part in connecting our go-to-market approach to customer value. We’re interdisciplinary thinkers leveraging diverse business backgrounds in engineering, education, management consulting, business operations (and more!) to define, manage and measure Datadog’s global go-to-market motion. We empower all of Datadog’s customer-facing teams with the right training, skills, and tools at the right time in order to maximize their ability to drive Datadog’s next phase of growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Datadog, the &lt;strong&gt;Enablement&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Systems Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; plays a critical role on the Enablement Operations team, supporting our global Go-to-Market (GTM) Enablement &amp;amp; Business Value function. This role is responsible for configuring, maintaining, and evolving our enablement systems and tool stack, with a strong focus on automation, scalability, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will partner closely with GTM Enablement stakeholders, as well as Sales Operations, RevOps, Internal Analytics, IT, and Sales &amp;amp; Technical Solutions teams, to design and deliver scalable, system-driven solutions that reduce manual effort and accelerate enablement impact across Sales and Technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for scaling Sales and Technical Enablement through systems, automation, and AI-driven tooling—reducing manual effort, improving speed to impact, and increasing operational efficiency across Enablement teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify, design, and automate&lt;/strong&gt; manual, repetitive, and error-prone enablement workflows across Sales Enablement, Technical Enablement, and GTM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and own end-to-end automated workflows&lt;/strong&gt; across systems,alerts, integrations, and lifecycle automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement AI-powered tooling&lt;/strong&gt; to support GTM teams (e.g., content discovery, learning reinforcement, deal support, coaching insights, enablement analytics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configure, administer, integrate, and onboard new enablement and GTM tools&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring seamless adoption and measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Enablement, Sales Ops, RevOps, IT, Data, and Product teams to &lt;strong&gt;translate business workflows into scalable technical solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a &lt;strong&gt;technical owner for enablement systems&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring reliability, security, scalability, and ease of use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reduce technical debt&lt;/strong&gt; by modernizing legacy workflows, simplifying system sprawl, and proactively improving existing automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices for &lt;strong&gt;documentation, testing, monitoring, and support&lt;/strong&gt; of enablement tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and communicate impact through metrics such as &lt;strong&gt;time saved, headcount avoided, adoption, and enablement effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad-hoc GTM enablement owned systems reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete data entry tasks (migrate records between systems, upload data, mass data changes via API or system upload)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist broader GTM Enablement team in content creation, configuration, net new use case builds leveraging toolstack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field (or equivalent practical experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of experience building &lt;strong&gt;automation, internal tools, or workflow systems&lt;/strong&gt; in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in one or more of the following: &lt;strong&gt;Python, JavaScript, or similar languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with &lt;strong&gt;APIs, system integrations, and cross-platform workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;LMS, Sales Recording, or Enablement platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;automation platforms, low-code/no-code tools, or workflow orchestration frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Zapier, Workato)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML or LLM-based tools&lt;/strong&gt; in practical business workflows (prompting, evaluation, guardrails, integration into systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and comfort working with &lt;strong&gt;ambiguous or loosely defined requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills. Ability to communicate technical concepts clearly to non-technical stakeholders and influence cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is critical to scaling Enablement efficiently. By automating workflows, building AI-driven tooling, and optimizing systems, this role directly offsets the need for additional operational headcount across Sales and Technical Enablement—allowing teams to move faster, operate more consistently, and focus on higher-value strategic work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous career development and pathing opportunities for internal mobility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free global mental health benefit through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Datadog offers a competitive salary and equity package, and may include variable compensation. Actual compensation is based on factors such as the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition, Datadog offers a wide range of best in class, comprehensive and inclusive employee benefits for this role including healthcare, dental, parental planning, and mental health benefits, a 401(k) plan and match, paid time off, fitness reimbursements, and a discounted employee stock purchase plan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The reasonably estimated yearly salary for this role at Datadog is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$78,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$114,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog (NASDAQ: DDOG) is a global SaaS business, delivering a rare combination of growth and profitability. We are on a mission to break down silos and solve complexity in the cloud age by enabling digital transformation, cloud migration, and infrastructure monitoring of our customers’ entire technology stacks. Built by engineers, for engineers, Datadog is used by organizations of all sizes across a wide range of industries. Together, we champion professional development, diversity of thought, innovation, and work excellence to empower continuous growth. Join the pack and become part of a collaborative, pragmatic, and thoughtful people-first community where we solve tough problems, take smart risks, and celebrate one another. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires a hybrid schedule and will be based in our South Charlotte, NC Headquarters (Tuesday through Thursday) and work fully remotely on Monday and Fridays each week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is not open to visa sponsorship or transfer of visa sponsorship including those on OPT and STEM-EXT OPT, nor is it available to work corp-to-corp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For the AllConnect website &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.allconnect.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;. Curious how AllConnect fits into Red Ventures? &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.redventures.com/portfolio/rv-home-client-services&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Curious how Home fits into Red Ventures? &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.redventures.com/portfolio/rv-home-client-services&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you excited about shaping the future of the move experience and making a tangible impact across multiple industries? Do you have a passion for building scalable and reliable front-end experiences that leverage GraphQL APIs to empower businesses to thrive? If so, we have an exciting opportunity for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Home team at Red Ventures is looking for a talented and experienced Fullstack Software Engineer to join our dynamic group. As a key player on our team, you will be instrumental in the development of our digital experiences, leveraging NextJS and TypeScript to support a diverse portfolio of brands within the Red Ventures Allconnect group. Our team is dedicated to crafting the next-generation digital platform, providing seamless and unified access to offerings from renowned brands, which connect customers to the services that they need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Red Ventures, we believe that exceptional products are built by exceptional people. We foster a collaborative and agile work environment where teamwork and innovation are at the forefront of our development processes. We highly value our employees and offer a competitive benefits package, ample opportunities for professional growth, and a commitment to diversity and inclusion. We understand the importance of a healthy work-life balance and provide flexibility, full parental leave, and support when life’s unexpected moments arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Red Ventures, where you can make a meaningful impact and help drive the future of digital platforms. If you are ready to take on new challenges and be part of an innovative and supportive team, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with product and design to build and deliver high-quality user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dynamic, responsive user interfaces using React and Next.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and integrate backend services and APIs using Node.js and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural decisions and help evolve the system design over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply appropriate tools, services, and architectural patterns to build scalable, maintainable, and secure solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, scalable, and maintainable code following best practices and design patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and collaborate with teammates to continuously improve code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pair program with team members to solve problems and share knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and engineers to deliver solutions that meet business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain application performance using metrics, logging, and observability tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to CI/CD pipelines and help improve development and deployment workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve the codebase, tooling, and team efficiency through automation and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a collaborative, inclusive, and growth-oriented team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of software engineering experience with a focus on full-stack development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in React, Next.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable front-end applications and reusable UI components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services and APIs using Node.js, including REST and/or GraphQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with third-party APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AWS services and cloud-based application development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and/or NoSQL databases such as PostgreSQL and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing automated tests using tools such as Jest and Playwright&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Git and modern development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines such as GitHub Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile development practices such as Scrum or Kanban&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a growth mindset by continuously learning, sharing knowledge, and contributing to team improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code such as Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with telemetry and monitoring tools such as New Relic or AWS CloudWatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to SDLC and team process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to debug issues and deliver effective solutions across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Even Better&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS certifications (Developer or Solutions Architect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with modern architectural patterns (serverless or event-driven systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test-driven development (TDD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Node.js ORMs such as Prisma or Sequelize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with WordPress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open source projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
