&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;not&lt;/u&gt; a remote or hybrid position and will require relocation if not already local to the Brownsville, TX area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position occasionally requires the ability to work extended hours and weekends when needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
